CHANGES MADE IN THIS FORK
-------------------------

This fork combines the product and control source in one repository. Its
modification areas include:

  packages/app        mobile and shared application surface
  packages/server     daemon, provider integration, agent lifecycle, plugin host
  packages/desktop    desktop integration, packaging and release configuration
  packages/protocol   wire protocol and validation
  packages/cli        command line surface
  control/            orchestration, Command Centre and supporting tools
  .github/workflows   build and release automation
  scripts/            fork-specific build and packaging entry points

This is a description of maintained source areas, not a count of development
commits or a statement that every feature has passed release acceptance.

The substantive additions of this fork are an orchestration and accountability
layer that does not exist upstream: named seats within projects, recorded
session ownership with provenance, operator-approved communication channels
carrying fixed message allowances and expiry, and generation fences that reject
stale authority after a session is replaced.

